# Consent and CSP

## Consent

- Consent Mode v2 defaults are **denied** (`ad_storage`, `ad_user_data`, `ad_personalization`, `analytics_storage`) in `Analytics.astro`.
- EEA / UK (`GB`) / CH: Google AdSense Privacy & messaging (Funding Choices / IAB TCF) is the CMP. Worker sets `window.__docuklinGeo` via `consentRegions.ts`; hide the site cookie bar there when ads are enabled.
- Other regions: site Accept/Reject banner. Do not invent a second CMP stack.

## CSP (`public/_headers`)

- Keep the allowlist tight. Add hosts only for documented vendor needs + a real console violation.
- Required today: GA4, AdSense + `fundingchoicesmessages.google.com`, Cloudflare Web Analytics, EmailJS (`api.emailjs.com` + jsDelivr SDK). See comments in `_headers` and `AGENTS.md`.
